abstract: "A free, open-source uTools-style pluggable developer toolbox: every tool is a plugin, install by dropping a folder, summon with global hotkeys. Ships with a local AI agent, screenshot pinning, clipboard history, JSON editor and more. 免费开源的 uTools 风格插件化开发者工具箱。"